/**
 * @file README.dox
 * @brief Overview of the built-in disambiguation library.
 *
 * @ingroup disambstd_api
 *
 * The `disambstd` directory contains the standard ambiguity-resolution
 * strategies that can be attached to a `glr_parser_t` through
 * `glr_parser_add_disambiguator()`.
 *
 * Available families:
 * - precedence-based choice
 * - associativity-aware operator selection
 * - syntactic predicate filtering
 * - semantic constraint filtering
 * - dynamic-programming cost minimization
 * - probability scoring and winner selection
 *
 * These strategies are declared in `include/glr/disambiguate.h` and
 * implemented in the corresponding `disambstd/*.c` files.
 */
